# Production renamed the bare `test` rule to `test 1`, which has the same
# effect as scoping it — but keep both: `test 1` is theirs, and `/test`
# states the intent explicitly.
#
# A bare `test` here matched any file or directory named `test` at ANY depth.
# That silently excluded src/test/, which is where vitest.config.ts points its
# setupFiles — so the setup file could never be committed, and without it
# vitest failed to load every suite. 112 tests existed and none had ever run.
test 1
/test
